    "innovation": "This paper uses a comprehensive A-Train satellite dataset to quantify the global aerosol-cloud radiative forcing from marine warm clouds, demonstrating that its strength is jointly governed by thermodynamic conditions\u2014such as atmospheric stability and humidity\u2014and the state of precipitation.",
