            "paragraph": "Cloud optical properties are obtained from the MODIS cloud product on the Aqua satellite (MYD06), including 3.7 \u00b5m cloud effective radius (Re), cloud optical depth (\u03c4), and the derived LWP (LWP = 2/3Re\u03c1\u03b9\u03c4, where pr is liquid water density).",
